00:06:13,524 --> 00:06:16,211
[Host] Quiz time. Four questions.

79
00:06:16,812 --> 00:06:20,627
[Slow] 今日は、何の日ですか。

80
00:06:21,427 --> 00:06:25,459
[Host] What day is today? It is the day to switch to summer clothes.

81
